# Keep the deployment to what the app serves. Everything here stays in the
# repo; it just isn't uploaded to (or publicly served from) Vercel.
#
# Paths start with "/" on purpose: a bare name like "rings" would match at any
# depth and silently drop assets/rings/ (the ring images) from the deployment.
/venv
/__pycache__
/*.py
/*.bak
/*.zip
/*.md
/bkgffl (9).html
/rings
/assets/rings/*.png
/tools
/tests
/.github
/.claude
